From 5a2e339c3f2b907de8d8fdb809cbeb348697a831 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 15:38:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] Do not offer public GitHub issues with the app logs

The error dialog, the sync status dialog and the log screen offered to
open a pre-filled issue on wger's public GitHub tracker with the app logs
and the sync snapshot. In ALMOVA the logs can name health data, so the
three actions are gone unless the build sets
ALMOVA_PUBLIC_ISSUE_REPORTS=true. Copying the logs stays, for a private
report to support.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VRSTuUkoebWWM2DLbPZAvR
